    "Verse 1:",
    "[A]O there'll be joy when the [E]work is done,",
    "[E]Joy when the reapers [A]gather home,",
    "[A]Bringing the sheaves at [D]set of sun",
    "To the [A]New [F#]Jerusalem.",
    "",
    "Verse 2:",
    "[A]Joy, joy, joy, there'll be [E]joy by and by,",
